  "description": "*“Turns out, I wasn’t a dirt spoon.”* \n\nAt the very end of a life spent at rock bottom, I discovered the truth: my life, which should have been that of a third-generation chaebol heir, had been completely ‘switched’ with someone else’s! At the moment I gave up on everything in despair, I heard the irritating voice of my ancestral spirit, and I regressed to before my life had been switched. This time, I won’t let anyone take it away from me. A story about a true third-generation chaebol heir taking on the challenge of managing his family’s conglomerate, starting from the position that rightfully belongs to him. \n\n(Source: Naver translated)",
